flowchart LR
    A([Start]) --> B[/Enter username and password/]
    B --> C[Auth.login checks browser data]
    C --> D{Credentials and status valid?}
    D -- No --> E[/Show generic login error/]
    E --> B
    D -- Yes --> F[(Save session in localStorage)]
    F --> G{Normalized role}
    G -- Admin --> H[Admin modules]
    G -- Manager --> I[Scoped workforce modules]
    G -- Finance --> J[Payroll and reports]
    G -- Employee --> K[Employee portal]
    H --> L[(Read/write localStorage records)]
    I --> L
    J --> L
    K --> L
    L --> M([End / Logout clears session])
